        <p>Mersey Street, Warrington. Makers of IRON CASTINGS from the smallest size up to 20 tons weight. Clean Well-moulded and of tl-ie Highest Quality. To buy the best finished castings is to frequently save 30 per cent, in labour.</p>
        <p>BRASS CASTINGS (any weight.) ; Gunmetal, Copper, Aluminium, Phosphor Bronze, Damaxine, Acid Proof Metal and all other Alloys. CONSTRUCTIONAL IRON AND STEEL WORK, Corrugated Iron Roofs and Buildings, Farmers' Hay Sheds, Barns, Store Sheds, &amp;c., Iron and Steel Tanks, Cisterns, Steam Jacketted Pans, Boilers, &amp;c. Repairs by Experienced and Skilled Workmen to all kinds of Machinery and to Steam Boilers, Gas Engines, Traction Engines, Motor Cars, Dynamos, Steam Engines, Oil Engines, Road Rollers, Motor Waggons, Electric Motors. ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING. Speciality Work. Drawings and expert advice submitted free.</p>
