        <p>You require them now. To postpone the wearing of Glasses because of groundless prejudice, is to take risks with your You cannot be too careful to preserve the quality of your vision. To begin to care for your eyes to-day is better than to-morrow. One eye, if not both, ruay be slightly defective, auct defects can only grow worse if the eyes are left to grapple with them unaided. Come and get the benefit of our Snientifio Method of Sight Testing and modern equipment. Our charges are low.</p>
