      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-12-04_WidnesExaminer_art0030" n="art0030">
        <head>CROWD AT THE WARRINGTON "A " v. CADISHEAD MA.TCFI,</head>
        <p>THE CROWD AT THE WARRINGTON "A " v. CADISHEAD MA.TCFI,</p>
        <p>The original of the portrait marked with a X will receive the " Examiner " prize of ss. on calling at the office in Bews(y-street on or before Friday next, December 10th. Two prizes of ss. are offered for every First Team match, and one prize of ss. for every " A " Team match at Wilderspool.</p>
        <p>The prizes for the Warrington v. Runcorn match have been claimed by John Lee, 26, Watkinr street, and William Lightfoot, 44, Lord Nelson-street.</p>
