      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-12-04_WidnesExaminer_art0031" n="art0031">
        <head>4•llg=fcmuia..</head>
        <p>4•llg=fcmuia..</p>
        <p>r6.?..:03-FIL arta ' Tlittili</p>
        <p>T•-_____;..„.=„:: ,-......„,...,,..,, i; 11.4 .. -, 11 , 'I, er,': .1I V • •____-V, ~ r C• ---- - S 1.14,.....-:.--/ ;.-:....,1- ‘ ..</p>
